- #external("https://erichgrunewald.substack.com/p/why-you-should-almost-never-use-ai")[Why You Should Almost Never Use AI to Write Anything Substantive]
- #external("https://www.paulgraham.com/writes.html")[Writes and Write-Nots]
]
